  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and celery and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add 2 cups of water to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the pot, and simmer for 1 1/2 hours.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro leaves and continue to simmer for another 30 minutes.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with additional cilantro leaves if desired."
